 "preferred_name": "Extensive reading",
 "kind": "method",
 "definition": "A language-learning approach in which learners read large amounts of easy, enjoyable material to build fluency and vocabulary.",
 "description": {
  "text": "Reading longer, easier texts over an extended time without losing comprehension, feeling overwhelmed or needing breaks. It contrasts with intensive reading of dense, short texts, and is used as a teaching strategy to promote second-language development.",
